{"author":"RebarBotNava","author_email":"joeoakhart+bot@navapbc.com","author_id":"594c-9dcf-5ad6-4e6d","data":{"compacted_at":1787427465550779001,"compiled_state":{"alias":"flirty-insulting-bullfrog","assignee":null,"author":"RebarBotNava","author_email":"joeoakhart+bot@navapbc.com","author_id":"594c-9dcf-5ad6-4e6d","authorship":{"signed":2,"unsigned":0},"authorship_ledger":[{"content_hash":"f5be100ce69945961d3cc665141c8b186b508ea002066959da605617fb63c6c9","event_uuid":"b4a87aca-aff7-45c5-b098-87086ee74c4a","position":{"commit_sha":"7daa40638ae6a47e58546ad0d5599e6322b1d8b6","position":"1787423336383876001-b4a87aca-aff7-45c5-b098-87086ee74c4a"},"signature":"{\"payload\": \"\", \"payloadType\": \"application/vnd.rebar.authorship.v1+json\", \"signatures\": [{\"keyid\": \"594c-9dcf-5ad6-4e6d\", \"sig\": \"\"}]}","signer_pubkey":null},{"content_hash":"74d0b881a55244a4295a3d4d1056975809b70c387b680941684bcf71d0c8ebbb","event_uuid":"9d8eb1b6-ae63-4d29-a308-8b4eb871488d","position":{"commit_sha":"26ddbb756f32aea0eaaa7b64e85532c5b16c83ea","position":"1787423351905402001-9d8eb1b6-ae63-4d29-a308-8b4eb871488d"},"signature":"{\"payload\": \"\", \"payloadType\": \"application/vnd.rebar.authorship.v1+json\", \"signatures\": [{\"keyid\": \"594c-9dcf-5ad6-4e6d\", \"sig\": \"\"}]}","signer_pubkey":null}],"bridge_alerts":[],"bridge_project":null,"claim_harness":null,"claim_remote_session":null,"claimed_session":null,"comments":[],"created_at":1787423336383876001,"creation_channel":"cli","deps":[{"link_uuid":"9d8eb1b6-ae63-4d29-a308-8b4eb871488d","relation":"discovered_from","target_id":"ec1e-be67-8774-4eef"}],"description":"Parity sibling of ec1e-be67-8774-4eef (staged-index store-read-failure race).\n\nThe primary fix (generation.sign_manifest) now RETRIES a transient `store-read-failure`\nfrom its pre-lock generation-baseline reads instead of aborting terminally, so a peer\nsession's in-flight `git add`->`git commit` staged index no longer blocks signing.\n\nThe `sign-review` recovery path (src/rebar/llm/plan_review/resign.py:179) establishes its\nOWN generation baseline with a single `generation.collect(..., ignore_untracked=True)`\nwrapped in a broad `except Exception` that returns the terminal refusal\n\"plan review generation could not be collected: <exc>\". A concurrent writer's staged index\nmakes that collect() raise store-read-failure, so `sign-review` — the very command meant to\nrecover a PASS-but-unsigned verdict under exactly these conditions — fails the same\nconcurrency race, with no retry.\n\n(resign's SUBSEQUENT signing step, attest.sign_plan_review -> generation.sign_manifest at\nresign.py:349, already inherits the primary retry fix; only the pre-signing collect at :179\nis exposed.)\n\nFix direction: wrap the resign.py:179 baseline collect() in a bounded retry on\nreason == \"store-read-failure\" (mirroring generation.sign_manifest's loop; deterministic\nreasons stay terminal), so the sign-review recovery tolerates the same NORMAL transient\nstate of concurrent sessions on one shared tracker.\n\nAcceptance criteria:\n- A transient store-read-failure during resign's baseline collect is retried and, once it\n  clears, sign-review signs (RED->GREEN test through the resign surface).\n- A persistent store-read-failure exhausts the retry budget and surfaces as a structured,\n  retry-after-repair refusal (not a one-shot abort).\n- Deterministic PlanRelationSnapshotError reasons (missing/ambiguous/malformed/reducer/\n  id-mismatch) remain terminal.","env_id":"b8a354e0-12c3-4cf2-bbf1-fcc9685d5126","file_impact":[],"file_impact_scope":"undeclared","keyring":[],"managed_refs":[],"no_file_impact_reason":"","parent_id":null,"parent_status_uuid":"","plan_review_phase":"planning","preconditions_summary":{"status":"pre-manifest"},"priority":2,"repos":[],"reverts":[],"status":"open","tags":[],"ticket_id":"90c1-c112-d076-4c96","ticket_type":"bug","title":"sign-review baseline collect aborts on transient store-read-failure (parity sibling)","verify_commands":[]},"source_event_uuids":["b4a87aca-aff7-45c5-b098-87086ee74c4a","9d8eb1b6-ae63-4d29-a308-8b4eb871488d"]},"env_id":"b8a354e0-12c3-4cf2-bbf1-fcc9685d5126","event_type":"SNAPSHOT","timestamp":1787427465550779001,"uuid":"4de17db9-a2c5-448e-9fc7-4f49fbdea0da"}